msgid "Enrollment"
msgstr "註冊"

msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "行為"

msgid "Face authentication"
msgstr "臉部驗證"

msgid "Face authentication for unlocking this session. This does not affect the GDM login screen (see below). Settings are stored in your current dconf profile."
msgstr "用於解鎖此工作階段的臉部驗證。這不會影響 GDM 登入畫面（請見下方）。設定會儲存在您目前的 dconf 設定檔中。"

msgid "Enable face authentication (lock screen)"
msgstr "啟用臉部驗證（鎖定畫面）"

msgid "Face retry mode"
msgstr "臉部重試模式"

msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "停用"

msgid "Fixed tries"
msgstr "固定次數"

msgid "Infinite"
msgstr "無限制"

msgid "Maximum face tries"
msgstr "臉部嘗試次數上限"

msgid "Enrolled faces"
msgstr "已註冊的臉部"

msgid "Checking…"
msgstr "正在檢查…"

msgid "Open Gaze"
msgstr "開啟 Gaze"

msgid "Could not open the Gaze app. Run gaze-gui from a terminal."
msgstr "無法開啟 Gaze 應用程式。請在終端機中執行 gaze-gui。"

msgid "A face is enrolled for this account."
msgstr "此帳號已註冊臉部。"

msgid "No face is enrolled yet, so face unlock has nothing to match. Open Gaze to enroll one."
msgstr "尚未註冊臉部，因此臉部解鎖沒有可比對的資料。請開啟 Gaze 進行註冊。"

msgid "Gaze daemon unavailable."
msgstr "無法使用 Gaze 服務。"

msgid "GDM login screen"
msgstr "GDM 登入畫面"

msgid "Enable face authentication at the GDM login screen. Requires administrator authorization. Note: GNOME keyring is normally unlocked by your password, so logging in with face only may leave it locked."
msgstr "在 GDM 登入畫面啟用臉部驗證。需要管理員授權。注意：GNOME 鑰匙圈通常以您的密碼解鎖，因此僅使用臉部登入可能會使其保持鎖定。"

msgid "Enable face authentication at GDM login"
msgstr "在 GDM 登入時啟用臉部驗證"

msgid "Administrator authorization is required to enable face authentication at the GDM login screen."
msgstr "在 GDM 登入畫面啟用臉部驗證需要管理員授權。"

msgid "Administrator authorization is required to disable face authentication at the GDM login screen."
msgstr "在 GDM 登入畫面停用臉部驗證需要管理員授權。"

msgid "Could not update GDM login face authentication: {error}"
msgstr "無法更新 GDM 登入臉部驗證：{error}"

msgid "Face auth enabled at the GDM login screen. Restart GDM (or reboot) for it to take effect."
msgstr "已在 GDM 登入畫面啟用臉部驗證。請重新啟動 GDM（或重新開機）使其生效。"

msgid "Face auth disabled at the GDM login screen. Restart GDM (or reboot) for it to take effect."
msgstr "已在 GDM 登入畫面停用臉部驗證。請重新啟動 GDM（或重新開機）使其生效。"

msgid "Face not recognized. Please enter your password."
msgstr "無法辨識臉部。請輸入密碼。"

msgid "Face not detected. Please enter your password."
msgstr "未偵測到臉部。請輸入密碼。"

msgid "Too dark for face authentication. Please enter your password."
msgstr "光線太暗，無法進行臉部驗證。請輸入密碼。"

msgid "Face authentication timed out. Please enter your password."
msgstr "臉部驗證逾時。請輸入密碼。"

msgid "Face authentication unavailable. Please enter your password."
msgstr "無法使用臉部驗證。請輸入密碼。"

msgid "Changing Gaze's settings or faces needs your password."
msgstr "變更 Gaze 的設定或臉部需要您的密碼。"

msgid "Sorry, face authentication did not work. Please try again."
msgstr "抱歉，臉部驗證失敗。請再試一次。"

msgid "You reached the maximum face authentication attempts, please try another method"
msgstr "已達臉部驗證次數上限，請嘗試其他方式"

msgid "(or look at the camera)"
msgstr "（或看著相機）"

msgid "(or look at the camera or swipe finger)"
msgstr "（或是看著相機或掃過手指）"

msgid "(or look at the camera or place finger on reader)"
msgstr "（或是看著相機或將手指置於指紋辨識器上）"

msgid "(or swipe finger across reader)"
msgstr "（或是將手指掃過指紋辨識器）"

msgid "(or place finger on reader)"
msgstr "（或是將手指置於指紋辨識器上）"

msgid "Password"
msgstr "密碼"

msgid "Face verified. Press Enter or click Authenticate to confirm."
msgstr "臉部已驗證。請按 Enter 或點選「驗證」以確認。"

msgid "Face authentication failed"
msgstr "臉部驗證失敗"

msgid "Confirm Face Unlock"
msgstr "確認臉部解鎖"

msgid "Failed to show confirmation prompt"
msgstr "無法顯示確認提示"

msgid "Please look at the camera..."
msgstr "請看著相機…"

msgid "Need more light..."
msgstr "需要更多光線…"

msgid "Face is clipped. Please move back..."
msgstr "臉部超出畫面，請後退…"

msgid "Please center your face..."
msgstr "請將臉部置中…"

msgid "Please come closer..."
msgstr "請靠近一點…"

msgid "Please back up..."
msgstr "請後退一點…"

msgid "Hold still..."
msgstr "請保持不動…"
